thoughtrecipe blackboard_sources
"Authored sources run in declaration order, each gated by its when predicate."

agent board uses blackboard

run board:
  source alpha:
    write state.alpha_out
    do relurpic:conformance_alpha

  source beta:
    when state.gate is ready
    read state.seed
    write state.beta_out
    do relurpic:conformance_beta
